<title>POLAND: KPBP-BICK JULY NET RISES TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>KPBP-BICK JULY NET RISES TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.44 vs   0.17</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.63 vs   0.36</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.57 vs   0.38</p>
<p> Sales		    9.89 vs   6.47</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.69 vs   1.33</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.53 vs   2.28</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.90 vs   1.78</p>
<p> Sales		   53.32 vs  39.69</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is KPBP</p>
<p>Bick SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
